    <string name="trust_feature_selinux_explain">I-SELinux inquma ukuthi yiziphi izinqubo ezinelungelo lokufinyelela kuziphi izifayela/izindlela kudivayisi yakho.\nLokhu kuvimba izinhlelo zokusebenza namasevisi ekufinyeleleni izifayela okungafanele azifinyelele kuzo: ngale ndlela inqubo engase ibe yingozi ivinjelwa, nokuphepha kwakho kugcinwe.</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_security_patches">Izinkinga zokuvikeleka ze-Android</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_security_patches_value_base">Ipulatifomu: %1$s\nUmthengisi: %2$s</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_security_patches_value_new">Isibuyekiwe</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_security_patches_value_medium">Kumasonto ambalwa edlule</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_security_patches_value_old">Edlule isikhathi</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_security_patches_explain">Izibuyekezo zokuphepha zikhishwa njalo ngenyanga ngu-Google ngokusebenzisana nabakhiqizi be-SoC ukuze zilungise izinkinga ezingasetshenziswa izinhlelo zokusebenza ezinobuqili ukuze zidlule ukuvikeleka kwesistimu futhi zibangele umonakalo ongapheli endaweni yakho. Izibuyekezo ezenziwe ziwe-Google zisetshenziselwa njalo ngenyanga kuzo zonke izinsiza ezisekelwayo, kodwa izibuyekezo zekhodi esobunikazi zingasetshenziswa ngumkhiqizi wedivayisi yakho kuphela. Ukuze uvikele idivayisi yakho, qiniseka ukuthi i-LineageOS build yakho isha njalo, futhi (uma kusebenza) qinisekisa ukuthi isithombe somhlinzeki wakho sibuyekezwe ngokwesisekelo esincomeke yi-LineageOS.</string>
