    <string name="trust_feature_encryption_value_disabled">"Kukhutshaziwe"</string>
    <string name="trust_feature_encryption_explain">Ukubethela idivayisi yakho kuvimba ukufinyelela kwedatha yakho uma ifoni yakho ingavuli ku-Android. Lokhu kubalulekile uma ifoni yakho iba yisela, njengoba kuvimba abantu ekufundeni imilayezo yakho, oxhumana nabo, nolunye ulwazi lwakho lwangasese ngaphandle kwephasiwedi yakho.\nUkuze ukubethela kusebenze kangcono kufanele usethe iphasiwedi yokhiye wesikrini enokuphepha.</string>
